independent contextuality for spin-1 systems”; we
mean only thatd ∗ = 3.
•(Numerically indicated) pure two-qubit wit-
ness:η 3(G) =α(G) under exhaustive numerical
search, andη 4(G)> α(G), indicatingd ∗ = 4.
Becauseη d optimization is non-convex, the upper
