the witnesses studied here.
The most striking entry in Table III is the exact co-
incidencev ∗(KCBS) =v ∗(Quad-C5,d=3): despite hav-
ing three more vertices, Quad-C 5 atd= 3 tolerates up
to 41.5% depolarizing noise—the same threshold as the
simplest known contextuality witness. Substituting the
